id: position-change
name: Position Change
uaType: magical
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks of Use Magic, Insight Score of 4+
tpCost: 12
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCostPerTier: 5
# "Target a Character within a Destructive Sphere AoE (centered on you)" - your targeted token, the Sphere the table's -
# "Make a Clash (Cognitive) against that Character. If you win, swap your places in the Battlefield" - a Swap button that
# swaps the two tokens; the Grapple it changes, changed. Refused while in a Grapple or Pinned (chat.mjs
# askPositionChange).
positionChange: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  An Instant Clash (Cognitive) at a Character in a Destructive Sphere around you: won, you swap places - taking their
  place in a Grapple as the Grappled. Not while in a Grapple or Pinned.
text: >
  Position Change: By linking your position to your opponent’s, you are able to swap places with them on the
  battlefield.
  –Ability Type: Magical
  –Prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks of Use Magic, Insight Score of 4+
  –TP Cost: 12
  –KP Cost: 5(T)
  –Maneuver Type: Instant
  –Action Cost: N/A
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: Target a Character within a Destructive Sphere AoE (centered on you). Make a Clash (Cognitive) against that
  Character. If you win, swap your places in the Battlefield.

  If your target was in a Grapple as the Grappler, also move the Grappled so they are in the Melee Range of the Grappler
  (the exact Square is decided by the Grappler). If your target was the Grappled in a Grapple, they stop being the
  Grappled and you become the Grappled in their place.

  You cannot use this Unique Ability while in a Grapple or in the Pinned Combat Condition.
